  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large cazuela over medium heat. Add the garlic and onion and cook until softened.",
    "Add the frozen seafood mix and cook until thawed.",
    "Add the rest-meat, cumin, salt, and black pepper. Cook until the meat is browned and cooked through.",
    "Add the tomato paste and cook for 1-2 minutes, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the white wine (if using), fish broth, and lime juice. Bring to a simmer.",
    "Reduce heat to low and let cook for 10-15 minutes or until the sauce has thickened.",
    "Stir in the chopped cilantro and serve over rice or with crusty bread.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy!"
  ],
